#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_insertRememberLineOnAwayChBox)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:256
msgid "If you check this box, whenever you perform an <b>/away</b> command, a horizontal line will appear in the channel, marking the point where you went away. Other IRC users do not see this horizontal line."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt den Klöönsnacktext en kimmrecht Lien toföögt, wenn Du den Befehl <b>/away</b> utföhrst. De gifft an, wennehr Du weggahn büst. Anner Klöönsnackbrukers seht disse Lien nich."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_insertRememberLineOnAwayChBox)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:259
msgid "Mark the last position in chat windows when going away"
msgstr "De verleden Steed in't Klöönsnackfinster bi't Weggahn markeren"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, awayMessageLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:266
msgid "Default away message:"
msgstr "Standard-Wegwesen-Naricht:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, m_awayMessageEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:276
msgid "The text you enter here is used as the away message when no message is entered as an argument to the <b>/away</b> or <b>/aaway</b> commands, and also when Global Away is toggled from the menu or via the keyboard shortcut."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, awayNicknameLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:283
msgid "Away nickname:"
msgstr "Wegwesen-Ökelnaam:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KLineEdit, m_awayNickEdit)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:293
msgid "Enter a nickname that indicates you are away. Whenever you perform an <b>/away msg</b> command in any channel joined with this Identity, Konversation will automatically change your nickname to the Away nickname. Other users will be able to tell you are away from your computer. Whenever you perform an <b>/away</b> command in any channel in which you are away, Konversation will automatically change your nickname back to the original. If you do not wish to automatically change your nickname when going away, leave blank."
msgstr "Giff en Ökelnaam in, de op Dien Wegwesen henwiest. Jümmers, wenn Du mit disse Identiteet binnen na jichtenseen Klöönruum ringahn büst un den Befehl \"<b>/away msg</b>\" utföhrst, ännert \"Konversation\" automaatsch Dien Ökelnaam na den Wegwesen-Ökelnaam. So weet anner Brukers, dat Du nich an Dien Reekner büst. Wenn Du den Befehl <b>/away</b> binnen en Klöönruum utföhrst, ut den Du weggahn büst, warrt Dien Ökelnaam automaatsch op den Orginaal-Ökelnaam torüchsett. Wenn Du Dien Ökelnaam nich automaatsch ännern wullt, laat dit leddig."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, automaticAwayGroup)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:306
msgid "If you check this box, Konversation will automatically set all connections using this Identity away when the screensaver starts or after a period of user inactivity configured below."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, sett \"Konversation\" automaatsch för all Verbinnen, de disse Identiteet bruukt, den Wegwesen-Status, wenn de Pausschirm angeiht oder sik för de nerrn instellt Tiet nix deit."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, automaticAwayGroup)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:309
msgid "Automatic Away"
msgstr "Automaatsch Wegwesen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, setAwayAfterLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:327
msgid "Set away after"
msgstr "Status op \"Weg\" setten na"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, timeOfUserInactivityLabel)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:353
msgid "of user inactivity"
msgstr "ahn Aktiviteet"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, m_automaticUnawayChBox)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:360
msgid "If you check this box, Konversation will automatically cancel away for all connections using this Identity when the screensaver stops or new user activity is detected."
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, sett \"Konversation\" automaatsch den Wegwesen-Status för all Verbinnen wedder torüch, wenn de Pausschirm utgeiht oder nieg Brukeraktiviteet opdeckt warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, m_automaticUnawayChBox)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:363
msgid "Automatically return on activity"
msgstr "Bi Aktiviteet automaatsch torüchmellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QGroupBox, awayCommandsGroup)
#. +> trunk
#: src/identitydialog.ui:379
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "If you check this box, Konversation will automatically send the Away message to all channels joined with this Identity. <b>%s</b> is replaced with <b>msg</b>. Whenever you perform an <b>/away</b> command, the Return message will be displayed in all channels joined with this Identity."
