#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/channel.cpp:130
msgid "Edit Channel Settings"
msgstr "Klöönrüüm-Instellen bewerken"

#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/channel.cpp:138
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Every channel on IRC has a topic associated with it.  This is simply a message that everybody can see.</p>"
"<p>If you are an operator, or the channel mode <em>'T'</em> has not been set, then you can change the topic by clicking the Edit Channel Properties button to the left of the topic.  You can also view the history of topics there.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Elk Klöönsnack in't IRC hett en Thema. Dit is bloots en Mellen, de elkeen sehn kann.</p>"
"<p>Wenn Du en Klöönruumbaas büst, oder as Klöönruumtyp nich <em>\"T\"</em> sett is, kannst Du dat Thema na en Klick op den Knoop \"Klöönruum-Instellen bewerken\" (linkerhand dat Thema) ännern. Du kannst Di dor ok de Themen-Vörgeschicht ankieken.</p>"
"</qt>"

#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/channel.cpp:177
msgid "Maximum users allowed in channel"
msgstr "Hööchsttall vun Brukers binnen den Klöönruum"

#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/channel.cpp:178
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>This is the channel user limit - the maximum number of users that can be in the channel at a time.  If you are an operator, you can set this.  The channel mode <b>T</b>opic (button to left) will automatically be set if set this.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dit is de Brukertallgrenz - De Hööchsttall vun Brukers, de to de sülve Tiet binnen een Klöönruum wesen köönt. Du kannst ehr instellen, wenn Du en Klöönruumbaas büst. De Kanaalbedrief warrt warrt automaatsch op \"<b>T</b>hema\" (Knoop linkerhand) sett, wenn dit fastleggt warrt.</p>"
"</qt>"

#. +> trunk
#: src/irc/channel.cpp:220 src/viewer/statuspanel.cpp:49
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>This shows your current nick, and any alternatives you have set up.  If you select or type in a different nickname, then a request will be sent to the IRC server to change your nick.  If the server allows it, the new nickname will be selected.  If you type in a new nickname, you need to press 'Enter' at the end.</p>"
"<p>You can edit the alternative nicknames from the <em>Identities</em> option in the <em>Settings</em> menu.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>Dit wiest all Dien Ökelnaams. Wenn Du en anner Ökelnaam utsöchst oder ingiffst, warrt den IRC-Server en Anfraag tostüert, dormit de Dien Ökelnaam ännert. Wenn de Server dit verlöövt, warrt de nieg Ökelnaam rutheevt. Wenn Du en niegen Ökelnaam ingiffst, muttst Du dorna de Ingaavtast drücken.</p>"
"<p>De <em>Identiteten</em> laat sik in't Menü <em>Instellen</em> bewerken.</p>"
"</qt>"

