#: src/viewer/ircinput.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<qt>"
"<p>The input line is where you type messages to be sent the channel, query, or server.  A message sent to a channel is seen by everyone on the channel, whereas a message in a query is sent only to the person in the query with you.</p>"
"<p>To automatically complete the nickname you began typing, press Tab. If you have not begun typing, the last successfully completed nickname will be used.</p>"
"<p>You can also send special commands:</p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<th>/me <i>action</i></th>"
"<td>shows up as an action in the channel or query.  For example:  <em>/me sings a song</em> will show up in the channel as 'Nick sings a song'.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th>/whois <i>nickname</i></th>"
"<td>shows information about this person, including what channels they are in.</td>"
"</tr>"
"</table>"
"<p>For more commands, see the Konversation Handbook.</p>"
"<p>A message cannot contain multiple lines.</p>"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>"
"<p>In de Ingaavreeg warrt de Text ingeven, de na en Klöönruum, Anfraag oder Server loosstüert warrt. En Naricht binnen en Klöönruum köönt all Brukers binnen den Klöönruum sehn, man en Naricht binnen en Anfraag warrt bloots de Persoon tostüert, de mit Di in de Anfraag is.</p>"
"<p>Mit de Tab-Tast lett sik de Ökelnaam automaatsch kompletteren. Wenn Du noch nix intippt hest, warrt de verleden Ökelnaam bruukt.</p>"
"<p>Du kannst ok besünner Befehlen loosstüern:</p>"
"<table>"
"<tr>"
"<th>/me <i>Akschoon</i></th>"
"<td>warrt as en Akschoon binnen den Klöönruum oder de Anfraag wiest. Bispillen:  <em>/me singt en Leed</em> warrt binnen den Klöönruum as \"Ökelnaam singt en Leed\" wiest.</td>"
"</tr>"
"<tr>"
"<th>/whois <i>Ökelnaam</i></th>"
"<td>wiest Informatschonen över disse Persoon, un ok den Klöönrüüm, na den de ringahn is.</td>"
"</tr>"
"</table>"
"<p>Dat Konversation-Handbook bargt noch mehr Informatschonen.</p>"
"<p>En Naricht dröff bloots een Reeg bargen.</p>"
"</qt>"

